pull_request.body:
These changes adjust for the discrepancies between our back-end DTOs and what's needed on the mobile side. 

I put logic for mapping between multi-entities to 1 DTO, for example, with a User and its friends -> in service classes, like `UserService`. I kept the Mapper files lean by simply supplying arguments, like `friends` to a user DTO method, for example.

@SeabertYuan and I made lots of changes to these service files to account for changes to user<-> friend tag relationships: `UserService`, `ChatMessageService`, `FriendTagService` + created `FriendRequestService`
